# MNCS language definition for github-linguist/linguist `lib/linguist/languages.yml`.
#
# Prepared against upstream `main` as of 2026-08-25 (schema fields verified:
# every current entry carries `type`, `tm_scope`, `ace_mode`; `language_id`
# is generated exclusively by `script/update-ids` and must stay omitted).
#
# Insertion: entries in `languages.yml` are alphabetized case-sensitively;
# verified against upstream `main` on 2026-08-25, `MNCS` sorts between
# `MLIR` and `MQL4`. The validation workflow
# (`integration/github-linguist/validate_linguist.sh`) performs this insert
# mechanically into a local Linguist checkout.
#
# `color`: teal, provisional — see PR-CHECKLIST.md before submitting.
MNCS:
  type: programming
  color: '#0e7c7b'
  aliases:
  - mncs
  extensions:
  - .mncs
  tm_scope: source.mncs
  ace_mode: text
